// A `/cmds/**`-style command object (OBI-149): no `/builders`/`/domains`
// prefix, so `default_creator` gives it `mudlib`, an always-unlimited
// uid -- exactly like every real player command handler. Every player
// command runs through an object like this one, which pushes `mudlib`
// onto the guard set *before* the target's own code (`workroom`'s own
// `appr` principal) ever runs.
pub fn run(target: object) -> object {
    return target.spawn_daemon()
}
